| Previous (broken) | Corrected | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| `Schema.describeSObject(objectApiName)` | `Schema.getGlobalDescribe()` → case-insensitive key lookup → `.getDescribe()` | `Schema.describeSObject(String)` does not exist in Apex; the dynamic entry point is `Schema.getGlobalDescribe()` which returns `Map<String, SObjectType>`. |
| `objDescribe.fieldsMap` | `objDescribe.getFieldMap()` | The property is a getter method, not a field. |
| `Schema.DisplayType.MULTISELECTPICKLIST` | (removed; only `Schema.DisplayType.PICKLIST` checked) | That enum constant does not exist in Apex; both picklist and multi-select picklist fields report as `DisplayType.PICKLIST`. |
